Copied 123 model tensors exactly, including selector/decoder; fresh optimizer, history, safety curriculum and proposal gate.
Explicit candidate-capacity migration: 64 -> 32; interval queries linearly resampled along rank, target anchors regenerated. New forward function; no unchanged-accuracy guarantee.
v16 adaptive mass_topk: cuda, Kc=32 internal (full cubic knot vector at all-keep=40), MSE tolerance=5e-05; 1500 train draws, 596 validation curves; real sources=3
Synthetic source contract: clean source-subset threshold-minimal certificate at RMS=0.00707107, margin=20%, audit_points=512
Simplification curriculum: training-only ranked-prefix teacher steps=6; certified over-count weight=1, symmetric true-count weight=1; complexity multiplier 0..1; safety 0+0sigma -> 0+0sigma. Deployment still uses one network forward and one final refit.
Validation checkpoint quality uses the worst source pass rate. Additional subset fits run only during training.
Per-curve simplification: scheduled complexity ramp; infeasible training curves receive no complexity pressure. Worst-source validation still governs checkpoint selection, not the training ramp.
Training-only synthetic mixture: low-K=35%, procedural-shape=25%, historical=40%; procedural shapes have no true-knot/count labels; validation distribution is unchanged.
Real sources are VALIDATION ONLY; training uses labeled synthetic splines and unlabeled procedural shapes, and test splits are excluded from model selection.
Online teacher refinement: 1 rounds x 3 deletion candidates; boundary ranking weight=0.5, candidates=4. Teacher mask agreement below is a training signal, not ground-truth knot F1.
